,"text":"vertices is at most 2⌊log₂ n⌋ + 1 intervals ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"segments(from:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), for path and subtree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries over a structure indexed by position."}],"title":"HeavyLightDecomposition","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HeavyLightDecomposition","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}